    "Anyway, I need to do some things here, I don't have time to waste..."

# game/script.rpy:378
translate english continuing_809663fe:
    # "Se for importante, provavelmente descobrirei..."
    "If it's important, I'll probably find out..."

# game/script.rpy:390
translate english continuing2_ff2fff77:
    # "*Suspira*"
    "*Sigh*"

# game/script.rpy:392
translate english continuing2_f14ae8c3:
