    "I've finally finished shopping..."

# game/script.rpy:393
translate english continuing2_30127e4c:
    # "Não demorou muito, no entanto eu gostaria de saber se o Enroladinho está pronto."
    "It didn't take long, but I'd like to know if the Enroladinho is ready."

# game/script.rpy:394
translate english continuing2_d7e20809:
    # "Pago todas as minhas coisas e me viro para verificar Apollo..."
    "I pay for all my things and turn to check on Apollo..."

# game/script.rpy:400
translate english continuing2_951bf169:
