    "I put the Enroladinho, leaf, and capsules in the bag."

# game/script.rpy:416
translate english continuing3_77106dd1:
    # "Limpo minha cabeça pensando no delicioso Enroladinho me esperando nos fundos da loja."
    "I clear my mind thinking about the delicious Enroladinho waiting for me in the back of the store."

# game/script.rpy:417
translate english continuing3_412d78e7:
    # "Caminhando pelos corredores, rapidamente chego ao balcão novamente e vejo Apollo tirando cuidadosamente meu Enroladinho do forno assim que me vê."
    "Walking through the aisles, I quickly reach the counter again and see Apollo carefully taking my Enroladinho out of the oven as soon as he sees me."

# game/script.rpy:423
translate english continuing3_36c63f35:
    # ap "Terminou?"
    ap "Finished?"

# game/script.rpy:432
translate english continuing3_de0d0ea8:
    # mc "Não até eu pegar meu Enroladinho hehehe..."
    mc "Not until I get my Enroladinho hehe..."

