    mc "But I wouldn't just buy noodles... I'd still spend all this time shopping and still have to cook at home."

# game/script.rpy:489
translate english continuing3_fb6fbd0c:
    # ap "Verdade..."
    ap "True..."

# game/script.rpy:490
translate english continuing3_9f8813e1:
    # "Nós ficamos em silêncio por alguns segundos..."
    "We stay silent for a few seconds..."

# game/script.rpy:491
translate english continuing3_0d5e5647:
    # "Eu pensei que teríamos mais coisas pra conversar depois de tanto tempo separados, mas acho que nenhum de nós consegue pensar em um assunto..."
    "I thought we'd have more to talk about after so long apart, but I guess neither of us can think of a topic..."

# game/script.rpy:492
